{"id":"43afe63c-e5e5-4d2b-8436-12c9703d7ba7","revision":0,"last_node_id":47,"last_link_id":66,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-420],"size":[4100,360],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Arbor · Two characters in different places — FastH3 OmniRef (MiniMax H3, 8 steps)\n\nThe same two characters in every clip, a different place for each scene. Every clip gets three reference pictures: **Mei** as `<Picture 1>`, **Kai** as `<Picture 2>` and the scene's **location** as `<Picture 3>`.\n\n1. Each character is a **Load Media** with one picture; **Tree to Data** gives a list of one, which ComfyUI repeats for every clip. The locations are one named group per scene (`# Tea house` …), flattened by a third **Tree to Data** — one clip per location.\n2. **Prompt Template** (*zip*) writes one structured OmniRef prompt per scene from an **action** line and a **dialogue and sound** line: the subject definitions name who is in which picture, `{name}` is the scene. Write spoken lines as `Kai says softly: \"…\"` and FastH3 OmniRef speaks them — picture **and** sound in **8 steps**. Keep **Model Sparse Attention** on *vsa* (keep 10 %) and **SigmaShift** at 12 / 3.\n3. **Construct Tree** with the location tree as its *structure* puts the clips back into scenes: **Save by Path** files them one folder per scene (`output/arbor/h3_two_characters/0 · Tea house/000.mp4 …`), **Video Grid** plays them side by side, **Concatenate Video** joins them into one film.\n\nClips are 124 frames (~5 s) at 0.4 MP to keep the demo quick — raise the resolution for real shots. Swap in your own characters and places with **Add…** on Load Media; up to nine reference pictures per clip."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Arbor · Two characters in different places — FastH3 OmniRef (MiniMax H3, 8 steps)\n\nThe same two characters in every clip, a different place for each scene. Every clip gets three reference pictures: **Mei** as `<Picture 1>`, **Kai** as `<Picture 2>` and the scene's **location** as `<Picture 3>`.\n\n1. Each character is a **Load Media** with one picture; **Tree to Data** gives a list of one, which ComfyUI repeats for every clip. The locations are one named group per scene (`# Tea house` …), flattened by a third **Tree to Data** — one clip per location.\n2. **Prompt Template** (*zip*) writes one structured OmniRef prompt per scene from an **action** line and a **dialogue and sound** line: the subject definitions name who is in which picture, `{name}` is the scene. Write spoken lines as `Kai says softly: \"…\"` and FastH3 OmniRef speaks them — picture **and** sound in **8 steps**. Keep **Model Sparse Attention** on *vsa* (keep 10 %) and **SigmaShift** at 12 / 3.\n3. **Construct Tree** with the location tree as its *structure* puts the clips back into scenes: **Save by Path** files them one folder per scene (`output/arbor/h3_two_characters/0 · Tea house/000.mp4 …`), **Video Grid** plays them side by side, **Concatenate Video** joins them into one film.\n\nClips are 124 frames (~5 s) at 0.4 MP to keep the demo quick — raise the resolution for real shots. Swap in your own characters and places with **Add…** on Load Media; up to nine reference pictures per clip."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":2,"type":"Arbor_LoadMedia","pos":[0,330],"size":[420,363],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"文件","name":"files","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"files"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"文件","name":"files","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[36,38]},{"localized_name":"图片","name":"images","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null},{"localized_name":"视频","name":"videos","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null},{"localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null},{"localized_name":"文件名","name":"names","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null}],"title":"Locations · one per scene (<Picture 3>)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_LoadMedia"},"widgets_values":["# Tea house\narbor:locations/tea_house.jpg\n\n# Bamboo forest\narbor:locations/bamboo_forest.jpg\n\n# Rooftop\narbor:locations/rooftop.jpg"],"widgets_values_named":{"files":"# Tea house\narbor:locations/tea_house.jpg\n\n# Bamboo forest\narbor:locations/bamboo_forest.jpg\n\n# Rooftop\narbor:locations/rooftop.jpg"}},{"id":3,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[0,733],"size":[420,400],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[56]}],"title":"Action · per scene","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["# Tea house\nMedium two-shot by the open paper doors. Mei and Kai sit across a low wooden table; Kai pours steaming tea from the iron kettle, Mei lifts her film camera and takes his picture, and he laughs and pushes up his glasses.\n\n# Bamboo forest\nTracking shot along the stone path. Mei walks backwards ahead of Kai, framing him with her camera; Kai follows with his hands in his coat pockets, golden light flickering across them both.\n\n# Rooftop\nWide shot at night. Mei and Kai sit side by side on the wooden bench under the strings of warm bulbs, the city glowing behind them; Mei rests her head on Kai's shoulder and he looks up at the sky.",false,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# Tea house\nMedium two-shot by the open paper doors. Mei and Kai sit across a low wooden table; Kai pours steaming tea from the iron kettle, Mei lifts her film camera and takes his picture, and he laughs and pushes up his glasses.\n\n# Bamboo forest\nTracking shot along the stone path. Mei walks backwards ahead of Kai, framing him with her camera; Kai follows with his hands in his coat pockets, golden light flickering across them both.\n\n# Rooftop\nWide shot at night. Mei and Kai sit side by side on the wooden bench under the strings of warm bulbs, the city glowing behind them; Mei rests her head on Kai's shoulder and he looks up at the sky.","parse_numbers":false,"multiline":false,"arbor_panel":""}},{"id":4,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[0,1173],"size":[420,300],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[57]}],"title":"Dialogue and sound · per scene","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["# Tea house\nSteady rain on the roof and the garden, tea pouring into a cup, the click of a camera shutter. Kai says softly: \"You never stop taking pictures.\"\n\n# Bamboo forest\nBamboo creaking in the wind, leaves rustling, footsteps on stone. Mei calls out, laughing: \"Smile, just once!\"\n\n# Rooftop\nThe distant hum of the city, a train passing far below, a soft night breeze. Kai says quietly: \"Same time next year?\"",false,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# Tea house\nSteady rain on the roof and the garden, tea pouring into a cup, the click of a camera shutter. Kai says softly: \"You never stop taking pictures.\"\n\n# Bamboo forest\nBamboo creaking in the wind, leaves rustling, footsteps on stone. Mei calls out, laughing: \"Smile, just once!\"\n\n# Rooftop\nThe distant hum of